            <div type="edition" xml:space="preserve">
                <ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><lb n="1"/>i-sa-za-ta-se ta-se o-na-sa-to-se ku-na-i-ko-se e-mi  ←<lb n="2"/>e-pe-se-ta-se o pa-i-se pa-ra-me-no-ne. |</ab>
            </div>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="DE" resp="Klaus Hallof"><ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><lb n="1"/>Der Isazata, des Onasas Gattin (Grabstein) bin ich.<lb n="2"/>Aufgestellt hat (mich) der Kind Parmenon.</ab></div><div type="translation" xml:lang="GRC" resp=" "><ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><lb n="1"/>Ἰσαζάθας τᾶς Ὀνάσα(ν)τος γυναικός ἠμι·<lb n="2"/>ἐπέστασε ὁ παῖς Παρμένων.</ab></div>
            <div type="bibliography">
